    "['interface [interface_name]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'interface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.0', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Huawei equivalent for the given Juniper commands:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.0\\n mpls enable\\n ospf enable 1 area 0.0.0.0\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. The Juniper \"set protocols mpls interface\" becomes \"mpls enable\" under the interface in Huawei\\n2. The OSPF interface configuration becomes \"ospf enable [process-id] area [area-id]\" in Huawei (process-id 1 is used as default)\\n3. Both commands are applied under the interface subconfiguration mode in Huawei\\n4. The interface naming follows Huawei\\'s convention (GigabitEthernet instead of ge)', 'trans_template': 'interface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.0'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'mpls enable', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Huawei equivalent for the given Juniper commands:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.0\\n mpls enable\\n ospf enable 1 area 0.0.0.0\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. The Juniper \"set protocols mpls interface\" becomes \"mpls enable\" under the interface in Huawei\\n2. The OSPF interface configuration becomes \"ospf enable [process-id] area [area-id]\" in Huawei (process-id 1 is used as default)\\n3. Both commands are applied under the interface subconfiguration mode in Huawei\\n4. The interface naming follows Huawei\\'s convention (GigabitEthernet instead of ge)', 'trans_template': 'mpls enable'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ospf enable 1 area 0.0.0.0', 'parent_command': ['ospf 1'], 'root': 'ospf 1', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Huawei equivalent for the given Juniper commands:\\n\\n##\\ninterface GigabitEthernet2/0/0.0\\n mpls enable\\n ospf enable 1 area 0.0.0.0\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. The Juniper \"set protocols mpls interface\" becomes \"mp